[
{
"id": 18772,
"en": "There's this rumor I heard...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18773,
"en": "...That the fire in Little Asia that invited\nthe Saio Triad in was set by the Tojo Clan.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18774,
"en": "Is that one you've heard before?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18775,
"en": "I certainly have.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18776,
"en": "According to the rumor, Sugai-san and I\nactually orchestrated the whole thing.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18777,
"en": "And after you brought the Saio Triad into\nKamurocho, you staged a war with them...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18778,
"en": "...Leading the police to arrest the sixth\nchairman on related charges.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18779,
"en": "With him in the picture, you and Sugai\ncould never control the Tojo Clan.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18780,
"en": "But now, the fake conflict you started with\nthe Saio Triad has turned into a very real war.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18781,
"en": "That's what the rumors say, anyway.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18782,
"en": "If that rumor were true...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18783,
"en": "...That would make Sugai-san and myself\nlittle more than traitors to the Tojo Clan.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18784,
"en": "It's preposterous.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18785,
"en": "I've answered your question,\nFourth Chairman.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18786,
"en": "And? What will you do?\nAre you going to help me or not?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18787,
"en": "Fine. Come back here later tonight\nand I'll bring you with me to see Lo.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18788,
"en": "A-Aniki! Y'sure 'bout this!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18789,
"en": "But you should know, Lo is expecting\nme to come alone tonight.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18790,
"en": "I couldn't tell you how he'll respond\nwhen he sees a yakuza by my side.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18791,
"en": "I'll take that risk.\nThank you for this, Fourth Chairman.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18792,
"en": "Aniki, y'can't do that! That freakin' bastard\nSomeya jus' wants t'kill Lo!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18793,
"en": "N' if he actually does it, how're we gonna\nget our answers 'bout Tatsukawa!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18794,
"en": "It'll be okay. I know he wants to kill Lo,\nbut I'll be there if he tries.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18795,
"en": "If I'd turned Someya down, who knows\nwhat violence he'd resort to?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18796,
"en": "If he's going to act like a feral dog,\nit's better that I'm holding the leash.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18797,
"en": "Nice. That's classic Sun Tzu:",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18798,
"en": "\"Keep your friends close,\nand your enemies closer.\"",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18799,
"en": "Hot damn.\nThat's actually kinda cool.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18800,
"en": "Kiryu-san. Someya's coming back\nhere to meet up with you tonight.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18801,
"en": "Once you take him to Lo, there's\nno telling what might happen.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18802,
"en": "Make sure you're ready for\nanything to go down, Kiryu-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18803,
"en": "Yeah, good point.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18804,
"en": "We'll wait here fer ya, Aniki.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18805,
"en": "Ain't heard a peep from Tagashira n' Matsunaga\nin Hiroshima, so I'll ring 'em up n' get the skinny.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18806,
"en": "(Things might get messy tonight. I should\nstock up if I need to before Someya gets here...)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18807,
"en": "Kiryu-san. Are you ready for tonight?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18808,
"en": "If so, you might wanna relax until then.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18809,
"en": "Yeah, that sounds good.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18810,
"en": "Okay. I'll let you know\nwhen Someya gets here.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18811,
"en": "No, there are still some things\nI need to do first.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main09|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18812,
"en": "Okay. Just let me know when\nyou're ready, then.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18813,
"en": "Isn't this the same scene I left?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18814,
"en": "As promised, I'm back.\nHaving second thoughts, Fourth Chairman?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18815,
"en": "No, you don't need to worry.\nI'll bring you to Lo.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18816,
"en": "Aniki. If this prissy boy tries anythin',\nwe'll be there t'back ya up.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18817,
"en": "Call us if y'need us.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18818,
"en": "Hell, I'd be happy t'sock 'im.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18819,
"en": "Where exactly are we meeting\nLo, Fourth Chairman?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18820,
"en": "He said he would wait for us in\nan old brothel called Shangri-La.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18821,
"en": "Shangri-La?\nWhat's he doing there?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18822,
"en": "Something wrong with that?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18823,
"en": "Well, you'll see when we get there.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18824,
"en": "Aniki. Y'better not let yer guard down\n'round Someya. He's dangerous.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18825,
"en": "Make sure you come home safe, Kiryu-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18826,
"en": "So, what did Lo say to get you to meet\nwith him again, Fourth Chairman?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18827,
"en": "It has nothing to do with the Tojo.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18828,
"en": "I'd rather not tell you anything\nmore than I have to.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18829,
"en": "I do wish you could relax a little.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18830,
"en": "Anyway, I wouldn't expect the warmest\nwelcome from Lo over in Shangri-La.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18831,
"en": "It's not quite what it used to be.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18832,
"en": "Nobody has set foot in there\nsince the brothel closed down.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18833,
"en": "All you're going to find there are\nthe dregs of society.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18834,
"en": "To venture a guess, I think Lo has every\nintention of testing you, Fourth Chairman.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18835,
"en": "He probably wants to see if forming an\nalliance with you is really a viable option.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18836,
"en": "What are you doing, Fourth Chairman?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18837,
"en": "Where exactly are you going?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18838,
"en": "We should probably avoid detours.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18839,
"en": "Shangri-La is this way.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18840,
"en": "There's really no need to run.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18841,
"en": "Remember to pace yourself,\nFourth Chairman.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18842,
"en": "Patience is not your strong suit.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18843,
"en": "Hold on a moment.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18844,
"en": "It looks like those guys want a fight.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18845,
"en": "How about some exercise?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18846,
"en": "We should ignore these weaklings.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18847,
"en": "Seems they don't know their place.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18848,
"en": "Let's mop this up.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18849,
"en": "You don't stand a chance.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18850,
"en": "Here we are. Shangri-La.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18851,
"en": "Lo has probably already noticed that\nI've come with you, Fourth Chairman.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18852,
"en": "Let's hope he still wants to talk,\nnow that you've broken your word.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18853,
"en": "I hope so. This would be\na complete waste of time if not.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18854,
"en": "Well, I suppose we'll learn\nthe truth once we're inside.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18855,
"en": "I'm shocked he asked to meet you here, though.\nLo clearly doesn't know how to treat his guests.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18856,
"en": "Yeah, for once I agree with you.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18857,
"en": "It's been ten years, hasn't it?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18858,
"en": "After Third Chairman Sera died, part of\nthe war for the Tojo Clan took place here.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18859,
"en": "You remember, of course?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18860,
"en": "The Dragon of Dojima and the Mad Dog\nof Shimano clashed here...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18861,
"en": "Apparently, he drove a dump\ntruck right through the wall.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18862,
"en": "It's your fault this place\nis in this state, you know.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18863,
"en": "Your toxic legacy left its mark\nacross this entire city, you know.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18864,
"en": "These days, the places that couldn't\nbounce back are gang strongholds.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18865,
"en": "I've heard what they do\nto innocent women, too...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18866,
"en": "The police are too busy with the\nwar to do anything, though.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18867,
"en": "Their inability to act has created\nlawless zones throughout the city.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18868,
"en": "Well? Do you feel even a shred of\nresponsibility, Fourth Chairman?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18869,
"en": "Either way, if Lo really is in this building...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18870,
"en": "...Wouldn't you think it likely that\nour friends here are on his payroll?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18871,
"en": "You're saying Lo sent a welcoming party?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18872,
"en": "They don't appear to be in\na very welcoming mood.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18873,
"en": "I doubt those weapons are\nmeant for conversation.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18874,
"en": "Come on, we can't afford to waste time\nwith these punks. Let's go, Fourth Chairman!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18875,
"en": "No chance we're getting up those stairs.\nLet's find another route.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18876,
"en": "There's a passage behind this rubble.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18877,
"en": "We should be able to get through\nif we can clear it somehow.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18878,
"en": "Let's clear this rubble.\nYou take that side.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18879,
"en": "A good kick from the both of us\nshould work, Fourth Chairman.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18880,
"en": "Are you ready, Fourth Chairman?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18881,
"en": "Come on. Ready, go!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18882,
"en": "One, two, three!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18883,
"en": "Nice, that should do it.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18884,
"en": "I think we could break through\nthe lock if we tried.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18885,
"en": "Fourth Chairman.\nUse this to break the lock.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18886,
"en": "Nicely done.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18887,
"en": "Hm? Who is that?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18888,
"en": "Hm? What do we have here?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18889,
"en": "Quite the spectacle, no?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18890,
"en": "Fourth Chairman. Let's just\nleave him be and move on.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18891,
"en": "This place is an absolute mess.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18892,
"en": "There's no time to waste.\nLet's keep moving.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18893,
"en": "It's sad to see it like this.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18894,
"en": "The finest brothel in Kamurocho,\nreduced to rubble and debris.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18895,
"en": "Time hasn't been kind to this place.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18896,
"en": "Let's try going up that ladder.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18897,
"en": "A dead end.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18898,
"en": "Another dead end...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18899,
"en": "Let's find another way through.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18900,
"en": "Hm? This wall looks pretty cracked.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18901,
"en": "Fourth Chairman. The walls have deteriorated\nin a few places. They seem quite weak.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18902,
"en": "If only we had a tool to smash\nthrough this part of the wall.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18903,
"en": "This wall looks weak.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18904,
"en": "Maybe we should find something\nto break it with.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18905,
"en": "Fourth Chairman! You might want\nto take a look over there!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18906,
"en": "That's actually a pretty nice find.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18907,
"en": "Give that hammer a nice swing\nat that wall we encountered earlier.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18908,
"en": "Incredible!\nWe can continue onward now.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18909,
"en": "It seems there are other breakable\nwalls in here, Fourth Chairman.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18910,
"en": "(I should be able to break this wall, too.)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18911,
"en": "(If only I had a hammer...)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18912,
"en": "Fourth Chairman. This floor is slippery,\nso watch your step.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18913,
"en": "Try to keep your balance!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18914,
"en": "Fourth Chairman!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18915,
"en": "Hey, Fourth Chairman!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18916,
"en": "Hello? Are you okay?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18917,
"en": "Fourth Chairman! You still alive?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18918,
"en": "I think there's something over there.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18919,
"en": "What is this guy!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18920,
"en": "So strong.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18921,
"en": "Fourth Chairman! Can you hear me?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18922,
"en": "I'll wait for you up here.\nGet here quick, would you?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18923,
"en": "Yeah, I'll be right there.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18924,
"en": "You took your time, Fourth Chairman.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18925,
"en": "We should be able to jump\nover this blockade.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18926,
"en": "The enemy is hiding from us.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18927,
"en": "Stay on guard, Fourth Chairman.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18928,
"en": "Come on, let's finish them off.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18929,
"en": "Hm? Still more of them?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18930,
"en": "They really want to fight.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18931,
"en": "I learn nothing from fighting this trash.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18932,
"en": "The floor is giving way all over here.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18933,
"en": "Do try not to fall through.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18934,
"en": "Man, that hurts.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18935,
"en": "Huh!? Who is this?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18936,
"en": "I knew this would happen.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18937,
"en": "It seems we'll have to settle things\nwith him before we can proceed.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18938,
"en": "I'm exhausted.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18939,
"en": "I expect Lo is tired of waiting for us.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18940,
"en": "We should continue onward.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18941,
"en": "Kiryu-san. I thought we had agreed\nthat you would come alone.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18942,
"en": "What is the meaning of his presence here?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18943,
"en": "I've come to expect betrayal in this country,\nthough. All thanks to Someya-san, that is.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18944,
"en": "Long time no see, Lo-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18945,
"en": "It's no wonder our search of Little Asia\ncame up empty if this is where you've been.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18946,
"en": "There are still a great many places in\nKamurocho outside of Tojo control.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18947,
"en": "This is but one of them.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18948,
"en": "All too true. However, I would ask that\nyou kindly relocate from this place.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18949,
"en": "Your stench has become overbearing.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18950,
"en": "Don't forget that it was you yakuza\nwho invited us into this city.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18951,
"en": "You were the ones who killed\nmy son as well.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18952,
"en": "I knew it.\nThe rumors were true, Someya.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18953,
"en": "You and Lo conspired together.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18954,
"en": "First you burned down Little Asia and\nbrought the Saio in to rise from the ashes.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18955,
"en": "Then you started a fake war\nto get the police after Daigo.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18956,
"en": "Correct. But as you can see, the war\nwith the Chinese is quite real now.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18957,
"en": "Once Sugai-san took over the Tojo Clan,\nhe felt it necessary to eliminate the Saio.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18958,
"en": "They proved quite resilient, though.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18959,
"en": "It bears repeating, Fourth Chairman.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18960,
"en": "Join forces with me, please.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18961,
"en": "Until recently, I'd thought killing\nLo here was the only option I had.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18962,
"en": "But together, we'd have no\ntrouble taking him captive.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18963,
"en": "Besides, you would stop me if I actually\ntried to kill him now, wouldn't you?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18964,
"en": "After all, he possesses information\nyou very much desire.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18965,
"en": "Think about it, though. If we capture him,\nyou can ask anything you want of him later.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18966,
"en": "Having Lo in captivity would also help\nme suppress the Saio further down the line.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18967,
"en": "Kiryu-san. Can you leave him to me?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18968,
"en": "My son was murdered right here\nin Kamurocho, after all.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18969,
"en": "That's all true.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18970,
"en": "You make no excuses?\nHowever, the Tojo Clan wasn't responsible.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18971,
"en": "The one who killed my son is the puppet\nmaster of the Yomei Alliance, Tsuneo Iwami.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18972,
"en": "Tsuneo Iwami...?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18973,
"en": "The son of Chairman Kurusu?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18974,
"en": "The very same. He brought us\nhere to use as an instrument...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18975,
"en": "...To change the Tojo Clan's leadership\nas he saw fit.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18976,
"en": "With this done, he attempted to kill me,\nbut it was my son who paid the price.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18977,
"en": "As for Someya and his patron, Sugai,\nthey would be nothing if not for Iwami.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18978,
"en": "In other words, they are pawns,\nunworthy of bullets.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18979,
"en": "I'll make sure you regret\nthose words, Lo-san.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18980,
"en": "You really think it wise to free\nthe man who just tried to kill you?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18981,
"en": "If I had to kill every man who wished\nme dead, I would never sleep again.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18982,
"en": "More men have conspired against me\nthan there are stars in the sky.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18983,
"en": "It would be simple to kill you here, yes.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18984,
"en": "However, that would only serve to prod\nthe hornet's nest that is the Tojo Clan.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18985,
"en": "It would be foolish to incite the hive\njust to crush one large bee underfoot.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18986,
"en": "That's all I am?\nOne bee in a hive?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18987,
"en": "Exactly. Furthermore, you will owe me a\ndebt of gratitude if I spare you now.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18988,
"en": "Gratitude? And what if I told you\nI'm not the gracious type?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18989,
"en": "You can do as you wish.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18990,
"en": "However, leaving you alive only lessens\nyour threat to me, not raises it.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18991,
"en": "Interesting. I wouldn't have expected a\nresponse like this from such a powerful man.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18992,
"en": "That said, I want you to\ntell Tsuneo Iwami something.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18993,
"en": "If it means avenging my son, I am\nprepared to risk all. Even my life.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18994,
"en": "I'll make sure he knows. Thank you for the\nlesson today, Lo-san. And Fourth Chairman.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18995,
"en": "Kiryu-san. Do you object to how\nI chose to deal with him?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18996,
"en": "No, not at all.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18997,
"en": "Watching you fight him gave me a good\nimpression of the kind of man you are.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18998,
"en": "That was ultimately all I wanted\nout of our meeting today anyway.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 18999,
"en": "Unfortunately, I didn't come all this\nway to learn more about you.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 19000,
"en": "I need to know about Tatsukawa.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 19001,
"en": "That's the only reason I'm here.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 19002,
"en": "Why exactly did you feel it\nnecessary to kill him?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 19003,
"en": "What did he do to betray the Saio?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main08|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 19004,
"en": "(Why would Hirose-san kidnap Haruto?\nI need to go meet up with Yuta at Serena!)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main09|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 19005,
"en": "Sorry I took so long. Were there\nany updates from Hiroshima?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main09|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 19006,
"en": "Did you learn anything new?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main09|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 19007,
"en": "We tried to contact Hirose-san, but he's\nbeen off the grid since he took Haruto.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main09|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 19008,
"en": "What exactly is the boss playin' at here?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main09|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 19009,
"en": "Why d'ya think he'd jus' take\nthe kid without even a word?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main09|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 19010,
"en": "According to Lo, Haruto has some kind of\nhidden significance to the yakuza.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main09|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 19011,
"en": "Beyond that, Tatsukawa's\napparently not even Haruto's father.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main09|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 19012,
"en": "Say what now!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main09|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 19013,
"en": "We'll talk about Lo later. For now,\nPatriarch Hirose is our first priority.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main09|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 19014,
"en": "Oh yeah, Aniki, we did actually hear\nsomethin' from Hiroshima earlier.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main09|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 19015,
"en": "Matsunaga n' Tagashira said the main\nfamily's on the hunt fer Hirose-san, too.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main09|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 19016,
"en": "'Parently Captain Koshimizu came\n'round the office n' started hollerin'.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main09|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 19017,
"en": "Koshimizu?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main09|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 19018,
"en": "What would a Yomei captain\nwant with Patriarch Hirose?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main09|#",
"max": null
}
